      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Based on the prediction model, here are the 25 open checking accounts most likely to be closed in the next 90 days, ranked by probability:\n\n| Account ID | Probability of Closure (90 days) |\n|------------|----------------------------------|\n| A001521 | 0.00025% |\n| A001058 | 0.00025% |\n| A000959 | 0.00024% |\n| A001195 | 0.00024% |\n| A001599 | 0.00023% |\n| A001623 | 0.00022% |\n| A000544 | 0.00021% |\n| A001221 | 0.00021% |\n| A001597 | 0.00021% |\n| A000835 | 0.00020% |\n| A001275 | 0.00020% |\n| A001632 | 0.00020% |\n| A000685 | 0.00020% |\n| A000739 | 0.00020% |\n| A000576 | 0.00020% |\n| A001029 | 0.00019% |\n| A001578 | 0.00019% |\n| A000542 | 0.00019% |\n| A000832 | 0.00019% |\n| A001265 | 0.00019% |\n| A000818 | 0.00019% |\n| A001120 | 0.00018% |\n| A000504 | 0.00018% |\n| A001113 | 0.00018% |\n| A001065 | 0.00018% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Note:** All probabilities are extremely low (around 0.00018–0.00025%), indicating that checking account closure is a very rare event in this portfolio. The model scored 887 open checking accounts and returned the top 25 by predicted likelihood.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — account_closure_90d — evidence `hermes-receipt:51e22627bf4952954619b2052a670495a20d884fa42ea9320f12626b5585aec5`",
